    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51954" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ.γάρ</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for also, for in fact</i>, combining <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί</span> (in various senses) with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
